# Scratch images and stray staleness reports that keep landing at the repo root.
# Both are throwaway output — the images are editing scratch, and the staleness
# reports are a snapshot of a moment, regenerated on demand rather than read
# back. They accumulated until `git status` was 32 lines of noise, which is how
# a real uncommitted change gets lost.
#
# NOT ignored, deliberately: docs/reports/ and docs/knowledge/, which hold real
# discovery output and knowledge entries. Ignoring those would mean work that
# can never be committed and quietly disappears.
*.png
knowledge-staleness-report-*.md
docs/knowledge-staleness-report-*.md
